{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10645030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10645030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1064503001:0":{"text":"엄마... 엄마...! 흐아앙...","source_cn":"妈妈——妈妈——！呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24AFA3045ED16DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064503002:0":{"text":"바토크, 이리 오지 마! 어서 도망쳐...","source_cn":"巴托克，别过来！快跑啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD04F3CE9F5A40510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064503003:0":{"text":"크르릉... 크릉!","source_cn":"嗬——吼——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3497D98A1520C4A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064503004:0":{"text":"안 돼! ","source_cn":"不——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2CD87DFE14E778B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064503005:1":{"text":"마물이 어린 바토크를 따라잡으려던 바로 그 순간...","source_cn":"魔物追上小巴托克的前一刻——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x711960911634FCD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064503006:1":{"text":"눈에 보일 만큼 선명한 황금빛 음표들이 전장을 누비며 얽히더니, 이내