":"엄마... 마물...","source_cn":"妈妈……魔物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x029A6276B97BAD90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:40:1064503027:0":{"text":"음악... 실, 실피라... 님이시여...","source_cn":"音乐……奥菲、奥菲戈斯……神啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0A8C64D1EEFEFCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064503028:0":{"text":"눈을 떴지만 창고 안은 여전히 어두웠고, 귓속의 이명도 사라지지 않았다. 바토크는 머리를 문지르며 현실로 되돌아오려고 했다.","source_cn":"巴托克睁眼，仓库内仍旧昏暗，耳中的嗡鸣没有消失。他揉了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x866B16E0EADC2811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064503029:1":{"text":"눈앞에 흩어진 악보에는 단정하고 수려한 필체로 낯선 주석 몇 줄이 덧붙어 있었다.","source_cn":"眼前散落的乐谱上，不知何时多了几行字迹清隽的陌生批注——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1553363958886065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064503030:1":{"text":"“9마디... 점점 여리게, 힘을 거둘 것”","source_cn":"“第九小节——渐弱，收束力度”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51E31E83CFD792B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064503031:1":{"text":"“23마디... 이 부분의 레가토는 한 번의 활 긋기로 끝까지”","source_cn":"“第二十三小节——此处的连奏，一弓到底”"